as found back inside a cell in  the containment cube back to his dormant  state where he would remain again for  the next few months that is until he  would feel the need to hunt prey once  again as the doors of the 40-layer steel  cube closed the electromagnetic supports  came back online and the fluid chambers  repaired and refilled the committee is  currently voting on whether or not to  allow  scp-106's containment facility to be  opened again for now the world could  rest once more dr bannon could take a  sigh of relief but for how long he  thought for that there was no way to  tell now go check out scp-049 the plague  doctor captured and scp-106 the old man  escape for more tales about your  favorite anomalous entities from scp  explained
 

